{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02976","headline":"与生公游石窟山 · 张九龄","name":"与生公游石窟山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"探秘孰云远，忘怀复尔同。\n日寻高深意，宛是神仙中。\n跻险构灵室，诡制非人功。\n潜洞黝无底，殊庭忽似梦。\n岂如武安凿，自若茅山通。\n造物良有寄，嬉游乃惬衷。\n犹希咽玉液，从此昇云空。\n咄咄共携手，泠然且驭风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02976.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02976","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}